#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man3/nl_langinfo.3:141
msgid ""
"Either a \\[dq]B<+>\\[dq] or a \\[dq]B<->\\[dq] character.  The "
"\\[dq]B<+>\\[dq] means that years increase from the I<start_date> towards "
"the I<end_date>, \\[dq]B<->\\[dq] means the opposite."
